nuvo-depth (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  Pi camera overlays and trigger module settings are not changed at package
  installation. Review `nuvoctl platform prepare --platform pi5`, then run it
  again with `--apply` only on the intended unit. A reboot is normally required.

